Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

We have been attempting to reach you regarding your account that has moved into default for non-payment. There is still time to resolve your account. We have modification programs available to assist you if you are having difficulty making your payments. If we do not hear from you this week, we will have to refer the file to our General Counsel for further handling.
Please contact us to make arrangements.

Thank you,

{!Case.OwnerFullName} | {!Case.OwnerTitle}

National Funding, Inc., the parent and servicing company of
Quick Bridge Funding, LLC

